<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/hardware.owl#InputDevice_PHONE_KEYPAD> a <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/hardware.owl#Keyboard>;
                                                                           rdfs:comment "A phone-style keypad where multiple symbols are available through multiple presses of a limited number of keys";
