<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#AssistedLocMethod> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                                                    rdfs:comment "Location method is assisted by the other party (Terminal assisted for Network based, Network assisted for terminal based)";
                                                                    rdfs:label "Assisted Method";
                                                                    rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#LocationMethod>.
<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#BluetoothBinaryLocMeth> a <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#UnassistedLocMethod>,
                                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#TerminalBasedLocMethod>,
                                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#ShortRangeLocMethod>;
                                                                         rdfs:comment """A room-oriented approach, uses a proximity detection method. An
access point is installed in every room. For each tag, the system than
finds the nearest AP, and respectively indicates its room location""";
                                                                         common:name "BluetoothBinaryLocationMethod".
<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#CellIdLocMethod> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
                                                                  rdfs:comment "Location method Cell-ID for cellular (in GSM, this is the same as CGI, Cell Global Identity)";
                                                                  rdfs:label "Cell Id Method";
                                                                  rdfs:subClassOf <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#LocationMethod>.
<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#CellularStandardAngleOfArrival> a <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#UnassistedLocMethod>,
                                                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#NetworkBasedLocMethod>,
                                                                                   <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#AngleOfArrivalLocMethod>;
                                                                                 rdfs:comment "Standard angle of arrival location method in a cellular network";
                                                                                 common:id "CellularStandardAngleOfArrival";
