<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#E-OTD> a <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#AssistedLocMethod>,
                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#NetworkBasedLocMethod>,
