                                                          <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#TimeDifferenceLocMethod>;
                                                        rdfs:comment "E-OTD systems operate by placing location receivers or reference beacons, overlaid on the wireless network as a location measurement units (LMU) at multiple sites geographically dispersed in a wide area.";
