                                                                           <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#Context_LocationEntity>.
<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/location.owl#SatelliteLocMethod> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
