<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/network.owl#bearerNetwork> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>,
                                                                 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
                                                               rdfs:comment "The network that provides the infraestructure of a Network Bearer";
