                                                                                         <http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/deliverycontext.owl#defaultComponent>.
<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/network.owl#homePLMNetwork> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>,
