<http://www.w3.org/2007/uwa/context/push.owl#maxWapPushMessageSize> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#FunctionalProperty>,
                                                                      <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty>;
